usage: initial_execution.py [-h] --action
                            {deploy,launch-qualification,check-qualification,launch-fit}
                            --host {5080,5090} --admission-sha ADMISSION_SHA
                            --integrity-sha INTEGRITY_SHA --qa-sha QA_SHA
                            --self-sha SELF_SHA

Bounded initial deployment/qualification for the metadata-only execution v2.
Uses explicit versioned paths and a new raw contract SHA. Frozen module
globals, scientific sources, original attempts and host deadlines are never
rewritten.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --action {deploy,launch-qualification,check-qualification,launch-fit}
  --host {5080,5090}
  --admission-sha ADMISSION_SHA
  --integrity-sha INTEGRITY_SHA
  --qa-sha QA_SHA
  --self-sha SELF_SHA
